#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:4
msgid "Tutorial: parallel and reproducible runs"
msgstr "教程：并行与可复现的运行"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:6
msgid ""
"Larger experiments take longer to train. fl-sim can execute the clients' local steps concurrently on a thread pool — with a one-line config change — and this tutorial shows how to keep the run "
"*reproducible* while doing so: at the end, two different backends produce **bitwise identical final model weights**."
msgstr "实验规模越大，训练耗时越长。fl-sim 可以在线程池上并发执行客户端的本地步——只需一行配置——本教程展示这样做的同时如何保持运行 *可复现* ：最后，两个不同的后端产出 **逐位一致的最终模型权重** 。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:12
msgid "The full script lives at ``test-files/tutorial_parallel_check.py`` and is exercised in CI. Prerequisites: :doc:`tutorial-first-experiment`."
msgstr "完整脚本位于 ``test-files/tutorial_parallel_check.py``，并在 CI 中被执行。前置阅读： :doc:`tutorial-first-experiment` 。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:15
msgid "The mechanics behind this are documented in :doc:`parallel_execution` (backends, guarantees, and how custom algorithms stay compatible); this page is the hands-on version."
msgstr "背后的机制见 :doc:`parallel_execution` （后端、保证、自定义算法如何保持兼容）；本页是动手版。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:20
msgid "Enabling parallel execution"
msgstr "开启并行执行"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:22
msgid ""
"Add ``executor=\"threads\"`` to the server config. Nothing else changes — algorithms, datasets, logging and the participation schedule all behave identically; only the per-client local steps "
"(evaluate → local update → build upload) run on a thread pool:"
msgstr "在服务器配置里加 ``executor=\"threads\"`` 。其余一切不变——算法、数据集、日志、参与调度全都原样；只有每个客户端的本地步（评估 → 本地更新 → 构建上传）跑在线程池上："

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:32
msgid "The helpers capture what we will compare: the final model weights (``weights_of``) and an exact equality check over them (``bitwise_equal`` — ``torch.equal``, not ``allclose``)."
msgstr "两个辅助函数负责我们要比较的东西：最终模型权重（ ``weights_of`` ）及其精确相等检查（ ``bitwise_equal`` ——用 ``torch.equal`` ，不是 ``allclose`` ）。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:37
msgid "The two backends produce identical results"
msgstr "两种后端产出完全一致的结果"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:39
msgid ""
"Run the same experiment on both backends with the client config's ``rng_mode=\"per_client\"`` — each client's dataloaders get their own generators seeded from ``(seed, client_id, round)`` — and "
"compare:"
msgstr "把客户端配置设为 ``rng_mode=\"per_client\"`` （每个客户端的 dataloader 拿到由 ``(seed, client_id, round)`` 派生种子的专属生成器），在两种后端上跑同一实验并比较："

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:48
msgid "Output:"
msgstr "输出："

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:54
msgid "The results are bitwise identical — not merely close, but the same tensors. This holds regardless of how many workers ran or how the operating system scheduled them."
msgstr "结果逐位一致——不只是\"接近\"，也不只是\"精度相同\"：就是同一批张量。无论运行了多少 worker、操作系统如何调度，这一结论都成立。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:59
msgid "Behavior of the global RNG mode"
msgstr "全局 RNG 模式的行为"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:61
msgid "``rng_mode`` defaults to ``\"global\"``: clients share the process-global torch RNG. The script runs the same comparison in that mode too:"
msgstr "``rng_mode`` 默认为 ``\"global\"`` ：客户端共享进程级全局 torch RNG。脚本在那种模式下也跑了同样的比较："

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:69
msgid ""
"Under the global mode the *participation schedule* and the *aggregation arithmetic* are still backend-independent (sampling decisions and reply consumption happen on the main thread in fixed order),"
" so the communication counts always match. The clients' local trajectories, however, consume the shared RNG concurrently — so their interleaving depends on thread scheduling, and the final weights "
"may differ between backends and between repeats:"
msgstr "全局模式下， *参与调度* 与 *聚合算术* 仍与后端无关（采样决策与回复消费都在主线程按固定顺序进行），因此通信计数永远一致。但客户端的本地轨迹会并发消耗共享 RNG——交叠情况取决于线程调度，最终权重可能因后端不同、重复运行不同而不同："

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:81
msgid "(On a small run like this one, the tasks often serialize and even the weights may match; this is incidental rather than guaranteed.)"
msgstr "（在这样的小规模运行中，任务常常自动串行，连权重都可能恰好一致；这是偶然现象，并非保证。）"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:84
msgid "Practical guidance:"
msgstr "实践建议："

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:86
msgid "**exploring**: global mode is acceptable; run-to-run variation is part of the measurement (average over seeds, as in :doc:`tutorial-visualization`)."
msgstr " **探索阶段** ：全局模式即可；运行间波动本来就是测量的一部分（对多个 seed 取平均，见 :doc:`tutorial-visualization` ）。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:89
msgid ""
"**paper-grade seed alignment**: either stay on ``\"sequential\"``, or set ``rng_mode=\"per_client\"`` — then every backend, every parallelism degree and every repeat produce the same trajectory from"
" the same seed."
msgstr " **论文级种子对齐** ：要么保持 ``\"sequential\"``，要么设 ``rng_mode=\"per_client\"``——之后同一种子在每个后端、每种并行度、每次重复下都走出同一条轨迹。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:95
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:97
msgid ""
":doc:`parallel_execution` — the full contract: guarantees per backend, the ``FL_SIM_EXECUTOR``/``FL_SIM_NUM_WORKERS`` environment overrides, measured speedups, and what custom algorithms must (not) "
"touch."
msgstr ":doc:`parallel_execution`——完整契约：每个后端的保证、 ``FL_SIM_EXECUTOR`` / ``FL_SIM_NUM_WORKERS`` 环境变量覆盖、实测加速比，以及自定义算法哪些能碰哪些不能碰。"

#: ../../source/tutorial-parallel-reproducible.rst:100
msgid ":doc:`tutorial-visualization` — plot the runs you just made reproducible."
msgstr ":doc:`tutorial-visualization`——把刚变得可复现的这些运行画出来。"

